{"ticker":"DHI","updated":"2026-10-23T22:51:51Z","profile":{"longName":"D.R. Horton, Inc.","shortName":"D.R. Horton, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Residential Construction","country":"United States","website":"https://www.drhorton.com","fullTimeEmployees":14341,"marketCap":41250344960,"trailingPE":14.059104,"forwardPE":13.161311,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.2368919,"pegRatio":1.24,"targetMeanPrice":152.35715,"targetHighPrice":206.0,"targetLowPrice":119.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":14,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.0,"earningsGrowth":-0.048,"grossMargins":0.21298,"operatingMargins":0.1299,"profitMargins":0.09154,"totalRevenue":33350000640,"beta":1.351,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":170.79,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":130.4,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.22},"summary":"D.R. Horton, Inc. operates as a homebuilding company in East, North, Southeast, South Central, Southwest, and Northwest regions in the United States. It engages in the acquisition and development of land; and construction and sale of residential homes in 126 markets across 36 states under the names of D.R. Horton. The company also constructs and sells single-family detached homes; and attached homes, such as townhomes and duplexes. In addition, it provides mortgage financing and title agency services; and engages in the residential lot development business. Further, the company develops, constructs, owns, leases, and sells multi-family and single-family rental properties; conducts insurance-related operations; and owns water rights and other water-related assets, as well as non-residential real estate, including ranch land and improvements. It primarily serves homebuyers. D.R. Horton, Inc. was founded in 1978 and is headquartered in Arlington, Texas.","summary_zh":"博士Horton, Inc. 是一家住宅建築公司，業務遍及美國東部、北部、東南部、中南部、西南部和西北地區。它從事土地收購和開發；以 D.R. 的名義在 36 個州的 126 個市場建造和銷售住宅。霍頓。該公司還建造和銷售單戶獨立住宅；以及附屬住宅，例如聯排別墅和複式住宅。此外，它還提供抵押貸款融資和產權代理服務；並從事住宅地塊開發業務。此外，該公司還開發、建造、擁有、租賃和